225 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 71 0 R/E(This introduces another important IEM dimension: human factors and ergonomics. Efficient systems must consider workload, safety, working conditions, communication and human decision-making. The best-designed process is one that improves efficiency without ignoring the people who operate it.)/Pg 13 0 R/K[11]>>
endobj

226 0 obj
