<</Title(Sapna B G, a sixth-semester student, directed the thought-provoking play \215Crushed\216 under the CARV English Club on 20 June 2026. The play explored the inner voices and self-critical thoughts that individuals often experience in their daily lives. It portrayed how constant criticism, judgment, and unrealistic expectations can gradually affect a person\220s emotional well-being. The narrative also highlighted the importance of having someone trustworthy to talk to during difficult times,)/Dest[28 0 R/Fit]/Parent 1766 0 R/Next 1907 0 R>>
